# Adversarial Architecture Review: Plan `router_subagent_surfaces_85bf9f09`

**Target Plan:** [`.planning/router_subagent_surfaces_85bf9f09.plan.md`](.planning/router_subagent_surfaces_85bf9f09.plan.md)  
